{"id":"n62524-2-7","stage":1,"title":"지하 · 黄泉","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62524-2-7-1","ko":"조금만 더 사셨더라면 엄마가 내 결혼식을 보시는 건데.","zh":"要是妈妈能多活一阵，就能看到我的婚礼了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조금만","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사셨더라면","meaning":"活，活着，生存","explanation":"살다：活，活着，生存；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더라면：假设过去出现另一情况：“要是当时……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"1","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄마가","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결혼식을","meaning":"婚礼","explanation":"결혼식：婚礼；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"결혼식","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31666","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보시는","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건데.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"活，活着，生存","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"存有生命。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"95cfb1a60ed967ea","term":"결혼식","zh":"婚礼","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3","entryId":"31666","definition":"宣告成人男女成为法定夫妻的仪式。","pronunciation":["결혼식"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/e32804b4c3cc1a0be940.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62524-2-7-2","ko":"엄마도 지하에서 보고 계실 거야.","zh":"妈妈在九泉之下也会看着你的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마도","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지하에서","meaning":"黄泉","explanation":"지하：黄泉；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"지하","audio":"/audio/7bb0cf204eb2116b3c8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62524","senseId":"2","lemma":"지하","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보고","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계실","meaning":"(尊称)在。表示继续做前面所述的事情或指其结果正在持续。","explanation":"계시다：(尊称)在。表示继续做前面所述的事情或指其结果正在持续。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"계시다","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61346","senseId":"1","lemma":"계시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"7bb0cf204eb2116b","term":"지하","zh":"黄泉","audio":"/audio/7bb0cf204eb2116b3c8d.mp3","entryId":"62524","definition":"(喻义)阴间。","pronunciation":["지하"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"e0bef9809d26f11e","term":"계시다","zh":"(尊称)在。表示继续做前面所述的事情或指其结果正在持续。","audio":"/audio/e0bef9809d26f11e8638.mp3","entryId":"61346","definition":"(尊称)在。表示继续做前面所述的事情或指其结果正在持续。","pronunciation":["계ː시다","게ː시다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/654ffdc1829d7af79ad0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.54,"source":{"url":"h